Tableaux -- a package for computing with Young tableaux
*******************************************************

Description
===========

This package provides the classes *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, *note
MutableYoungTableau: MutableYoungTableau,, and *note Tabloid: Tabloid,. These
classes can be used to construct (skew) tableaux, and entries in the boxes may
be any class. See the constructor's page *note youngTableau: youngTableau, for
some basics of this class.

