|                                                                             |
|o1 = -*a bagged sequence of length 144*-                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : Bag                                                                     |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Partition from {3,1})                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : for i from 0 to 4 do print theBag#i                                     |
|            ┌───┬───┐                                                        |
|            │ 1 │ 1 │                                                        |
