  * Inputs:
      * T, an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, a
        tableau.
  * Outputs:
      * l, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the permutations in the column
        stabilizer.

Description
===========

A permutation acts on a tableau by permuting its entries. The column stabilizer
of a tableau is the group of permutations that leave boxes in their original
columns.

