isSemistandard -- checks if a Young tableau is semistandard
***********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        isSemistandard T
  * Inputs:
      * T, an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, a Young
        tableau.
  * Outputs:
      * b, a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, returns true if the
        tableau is semistandard, and false otherwise.

Description
===========

A semistandard Young tableau (SSYT) has entries in $\N=\{1,2,3,\ldots\}$ where
the rows are weakly increasing, and columns are strictly increasing. Here, we
also require $\lambda$ and $\mu$ to have nonnegative parts.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : T = youngTableau(new Partition from {5,3,2}, new Partition from {3,1},  |
|                                                                             |
|                 ┌───┬───┐                                                   |
|o1 =             │ 1 │ 3 │                                                   |
|         ┌───┬───┼───┴───┘                                                   |
|         │ 2 │ 2 │                                                           |
|     ┌───┼───┼───┘                                                           |
|     │ 2 │ 3 │                                                               |
|     └───┴───┘                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : YoungTableau                                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{1,3,2,2,2,3})                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : isSemistandard T                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note isStandard: isStandard, -- checks if a Young tableau is standard

