mutableYoungTableau -- constructor for type MutableYoungTableau
***************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        mutableYoungTableau(lam, mu, entryList)
        mutableYoungTableau((lam,mu),entryList)
  * Inputs:
      * lam, an instance of the type *note Partition: (Macaulay2Doc)Partition,,
        the outer shape $\lambda$.
      * mu, an instance of the type *note Partition: (Macaulay2Doc)Partition,,
        the inner shape $\mu$. If not given, then it is assumed to be the $0$
        partition.
      * entryList, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the filling of the boxes.
        If not given, then box entries are assumed to be the empty string "".
  * Outputs:
      * T, an instance of the type *note MutableYoungTableau:
        MutableYoungTableau,, a skew Young tableau of shape $\lambda/\mu$ with
        the given (mutable) filling.
  * Consequences:
      * The list of entries has length equal to
        $\sum_{i=1}^{\ell(\lambda)}|\lambda_i-\mu_i|$. E.g., if $\lambda=(2)$
        and $\mu=(5)$, then the entry list must have length $3$.
      * None of the entries are null.

Description
===========

This is the same as type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, except that the
entries may be changed.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : T = mutableYoungTableau(new Partition from {4,2,1}, new Partition from  |
|                                                                             |
|         ┌───┬───┬───┐                                                       |
|o1 =     │ 1 │ 2 │ 3 │                                                       |
|     ┌───┼───┼───┴───┘                                                       |
|     │ 4 │ 5 │                                                               |
|     ├───┼───┘                                                               |
|     │ 6 │                                                                   |
|     └───┘                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : MutableYoungTableau                                                     |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{1}, toList(1..6))                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : T_(0,2) = 9                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = 9                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : T                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|         ┌───┬───┬───┐                                                       |
|o3 =     │ 1 │ 9 │ 3 │                                                       |
|     ┌───┼───┼───┴───┘                                                       |
|     │ 4 │ 5 │                                                               |
|     ├───┼───┘                                                               |
|     │ 6 │                                                                   |
|     └───┘                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : MutableYoungTableau                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

