numColumns(YoungTableau) -- the number of columns in a tableau
**************************************************************

  * Function: *note numColumns: (Macaulay2Doc)numColumns_lpMatrix_rp,
  * Usage: 
        numColumns T
  * Inputs:
      * T, an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, a
        tableau.
  * Outputs:
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the number of columns in T.

Description
===========

The number of rows is the same as largest part in its shape, minus the smallest
part in the shape.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : drawInnerShape true                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : T = youngTableau(new Partition from {4,3,1}, new Partition from {1,1,1})|
|                                                                             |
|         ┌───┬───┬───┐                                                       |
|o2 =   ■ │   │   │   │                                                       |
|         ├───┼───┼───┘                                                       |
|       ■ │   │   │                                                           |
|         └───┴───┘                                                           |
|       ■                                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : YoungTableau                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : numColumns T                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = 3                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Note that, if a shape contains negative parts, then columns may have negative
indices.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : T' = youngTableau(new Partition from {4,3,1}, new Partition from        |
|                                                                             |
|     ┌───║───┬───┬───┬───┐                                                   |
|o4 = │   ║   │   │   │   │                                                   |
|     └───║───┼───┼───┼───┘                                                   |
