+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : T = youngTableau(new Partition from {4,3,1,0}, new Partition from       |
|                                                                             |
|         ┌───┬───┬───┐                                                       |
|o1 =     │   │   │   │                                                       |
