|               ┌────┬────┬────┬────┐                                         |
|o1 =           │ 10 │ 11 │ 12 │ 13 │                                         |
|     ┌────┬────┼────┼────┴────┴────┘                                         |
|     │ 14 │ 15 │ 16 │                                                        |
|     ├────┼────┼────┘                                                        |
|     │ 17 │ 18 │                                                             |
|     └────┴────┘                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : YoungTableau                                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|toList(10..18))                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : readingWord T                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = {17, 14, 18, 15, 16, 10, 11, 12, 13}                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : List                                                                    |
