representative -- get a canonical representative of a tabloid
*************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        representative T
  * Inputs:
      * T, an instance of the type *note Tabloid: Tabloid,, a tabloid.
  * Outputs:
      * T', an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, a
        representative of T.

Description
===========

A tabloid is an equivalence class of Young Tableaux. We can obtain a canonical
representative by sorting the boxes in each row.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : T = tabloid(new Partition from {6,3,2}, new Partition from {2},         |
|                                                                             |
|             ┌───────────────┐                                               |
|o1 =         │ 9   5   1   2 │                                               |
|     ┌───────┴───┬───────────┘                                               |
|     │ 4   3   7 │                                                           |
|     ├───────┬───┘                                                           |
|     │ 8   6 │                                                               |
|     └───────┘                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : Tabloid                                                                 |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{9,5,1,2,4,3,7,8,6})                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : representative T                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|             ┌───┬───┬───┬───┐                                               |
|o2 =         │ 1 │ 2 │ 5 │ 9 │                                               |
|     ┌───┬───┼───┼───┴───┴───┘                                               |
|     │ 3 │ 4 │ 7 │                                                           |
|     ├───┼───┼───┘                                                           |
|     │ 6 │ 8 │                                                               |
|     └───┴───┘                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : YoungTableau                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note Tabloid: Tabloid, -- a type of HashTable representing a Young tabloid

Ways to use representative:
===========================

  * "representative(Tabloid)"

