rowStabilizer -- the row stabilizer of a tableau
************************************************

  * Usage: 
        rowStabilizer T
  * Inputs:
      * T, an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, a
        tableau.
  * Outputs:
      * l, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the permutations in the row
        stabilizer.

Description
===========

A permutation acts on a tableau by permuting its entries. The row stabilizer of
a tableau is the group of permutations that leave boxes in their original rows.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : T = youngTableau(new Partition from {2,2,1}, {1,4,2,5,3})               |
|                                                                             |
|     ┌───┬───┐                                                               |
|o1 = │ 1 │ 4 │                                                               |
|     ├───┼───┤                                                               |
|     │ 2 │ 5 │                                                               |
|     ├───┼───┘                                                               |
|     │ 3 │                                                                   |
|     └───┘                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : YoungTableau                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : rowStabilizer T                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = {Permutation{1, 2, 3, 4, 5}, Permutation{1, 5, 3, 4, 2}, Permutation{4, |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     2, 3, 1, 5}, Permutation{4, 5, 3, 1, 2}}                                |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

