toIndex -- get the index of a box, given its position
*****************************************************

  * Usage: 
        toIndex(T,seq)
        toIndex(T,(i,j))
        toIndex(seq,T)
        toIndex((i,j),T)
  * Inputs:
      * T, an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, a
        tableau.
      * seq, a *note sequence: (Macaulay2Doc)Sequence,, the position (i,j) of a
        box.
  * Outputs:
      * k, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the index k of the box in T.

Description
===========

The boxes in entries T fill the tableau from top to bottom, and left to right.
Hence, a position (i,j) corresponds to an index k in entries T

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : T = youngTableau(new Partition from {6,3,2}, new Partition from {2},    |
|                                                                             |
|               ┌────┬────┬────┬────┐                                         |
|o1 =           │ 10 │ 11 │ 12 │ 13 │                                         |
|     ┌────┬────┼────┼────┴────┴────┘                                         |
|     │ 14 │ 15 │ 16 │                                                        |
|     ├────┼────┼────┘                                                        |
|     │ 17 │ 18 │                                                             |
|     └────┴────┘                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : YoungTableau                                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|toList(10..18))                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : thePosition = (1,2)                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = (1, 2)                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Sequence                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : T_thePosition                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = 16                                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : theIndex = toIndex(T,thePosition)                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = 6                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : (entries T)#theIndex                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = 16                                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

We may replace the filling in each box with its index to see the order.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : youngTableau(new Partition from {6,3,2}, new Partition from {2},        |
|                                                                             |
|             ┌───┬───┬───┬───┐                                               |
|o6 =         │ 0 │ 1 │ 2 │ 3 │                                               |
|     ┌───┬───┼───┼───┴───┴───┘                                               |
|     │ 4 │ 5 │ 6 │                                                           |
|     ├───┼───┼───┘                                                           |
|     │ 7 │ 8 │                                                               |
|     └───┴───┘                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : YoungTableau                                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|toList(0..(size T - 1)))                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

We may also replace the filling in each box with the corresponding position.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : entryList = for i from 0 to size T - 1 list toPosition(T,i)             |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = {(0, 2), (0, 3), (0, 4), (0, 5), (1, 0), (1, 1), (1, 2), (2, 0), (2, 1)}|
|                                                                             |
|o7 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : youngTableau(new Partition from {6,3,2}, new Partition from {2},        |
|                                                                             |
|                       ┌────────┬────────┬────────┬────────┐                 |
|o8 =                   │ (0, 2) │ (0, 3) │ (0, 4) │ (0, 5) │                 |
|     ┌────────┬────────┼────────┼────────┴────────┴────────┘                 |
|     │ (1, 0) │ (1, 1) │ (1, 2) │                                            |
|     ├────────┼────────┼────────┘                                            |
|     │ (2, 0) │ (2, 1) │                                                     |
|     └────────┴────────┘                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : YoungTableau                                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|entryList)                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note toPosition: toPosition, -- get the position of a box, given its index
  * *note positionList: positionList, -- get the positions of all the boxes in
    a tableau

