File: Tableaux.info, Node: YoungTableau, Next: youngTableau, Prev: youngDiagram, Up: Top

YoungTableau -- a type of HashTable representing a Young tableau
****************************************************************

Description
===========

An object of type YoungTableau is a hash table containing two shapes of type
*note Partition: (Macaulay2Doc)Partition,, and a list of box entries. The
entries may have any type, except for *note null: (Macaulay2Doc)null, objects.

The inner and outer shapes, $\lambda$ and $\mu$ respectively, can be any
sequence of integers. In particular, it accepts negative parts, compositions,
rows where $\lambda_i < \mu_i$, and compositions where
$\ell(\lambda)\neq\ell(\mu)$.

+---------------------------------------+
|i1 : lam = new Partition from {4,3,2}  |
|                                       |
|o1 = Partition{4, 3, 2}                |
|                                       |
|o1 : Partition                         |
+---------------------------------------+
|i2 : mu = new Partition from {3,1}     |
|                                       |
|o2 = Partition{3, 1}                   |
|                                       |
|o2 : Partition                         |
+---------------------------------------+
|i3 : entryList = {1,2,3,3,9}           |
|                                       |
|o3 = {1, 2, 3, 3, 9}                   |
|                                       |
|o3 : List                              |
+---------------------------------------+
|i4 : T = youngTableau(lam,mu,entryList)|
|                                       |
|                 ┌───┐                 |
|o4 =             │ 1 │                 |
|         ┌───┬───┼───┘                 |
|         │ 2 │ 3 │                     |
|     ┌───┼───┼───┘                     |
|     │ 3 │ 9 │                         |
|     └───┴───┘                         |
|                                       |
|o4 : YoungTableau                      |
+---------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note youngTableau: youngTableau, -- constructor for type YoungTableau

Types of YoungTableau:
======================

  * *note MutableYoungTableau: MutableYoungTableau, -- a type of HashTable
    representing a Young tableau, with mutable entries
  * *note Tabloid: Tabloid, -- a type of HashTable representing a Young tabloid

