youngTableau -- constructor for type YoungTableau
*************************************************

  * Usage: 
        youngTableau(lam, mu, entryList)
        youngTableau((lam,mu),entryList)
        youngTableau(lam, entryList)
  * Inputs:
      * lam, an instance of the type *note Partition: (Macaulay2Doc)Partition,,
        the outer shape $\lambda$.
      * mu, an instance of the type *note Partition: (Macaulay2Doc)Partition,,
        the inner shape $\mu$. If not given, then it is assumed to be the $0$
        partition.
      * entryList, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the filling of the boxes.
        If not given, then box entries are assumed to be the empty string "".
  * Outputs:
      * T, an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, a skew
        Young tableau of shape $\lambda/\mu$ with the given filling.
  * Consequences:
      * The list of entries has length equal to
        $\sum_{i=1}^{\ell(\lambda)}|\lambda_i-\mu_i|$. E.g., if $\lambda=(2)$
        and $\mu=(5)$, then the entry list must have length $3$.
      * None of the entries are null.

Description
===========

+---------------------------------------+
|i1 : lam = new Partition from {4,3,2}  |
|                                       |
|o1 = Partition{4, 3, 2}                |
|                                       |
|o1 : Partition                         |
+---------------------------------------+
|i2 : mu = new Partition from {3,1}     |
|                                       |
|o2 = Partition{3, 1}                   |
|                                       |
|o2 : Partition                         |
+---------------------------------------+
|i3 : entryList = {1,2,3,3,9}           |
|                                       |
|o3 = {1, 2, 3, 3, 9}                   |
|                                       |
|o3 : List                              |
+---------------------------------------+
|i4 : T = youngTableau(lam,mu,entryList)|
|                                       |
|                 ┌───┐                 |
|o4 =             │ 1 │                 |
|         ┌───┬───┼───┘                 |
|         │ 2 │ 3 │                     |
|     ┌───┼───┼───┘                     |
|     │ 3 │ 9 │                         |
|     └───┴───┘                         |
|                                       |
|o4 : YoungTableau                      |
+---------------------------------------+

We may construct tableaux with any compositions.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : youngTableau(new Partition from {3,5,1}, new Partition from {0,1},      |
|                                                                             |
|     ┌───┬───┬───┐                                                           |
|o5 = │ 7 │ & │ 4 │                                                           |
|     └───┼───┼───┼───┬───┐                                                   |
|         │ 2 │ g │ u │ 6 │                                                   |
|     ┌───┼───┴───┴───┴───┘                                                   |
|     │ 0 │                                                                   |
|     └───┘                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : YoungTableau                                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{7,"&",4,2,"g","u",6,0})                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

The shapes may have negative parts. In this case, a vertical line is drawn by
*note net: YoungTableau, to indicate that negative parts are to the left.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : youngTableau(new Partition from {3,-3,-1}, new Partition from           |
|                                                                             |
|             ┌───┬───║───┬───┬───┐                                           |
|o6 =         │   │   ║   │   │   │                                           |
|     ┌───┐   └───┴───║───┴───┴───┘                                           |
|     │   │           ║                                                       |
|     └───┘           ║                                                       |
|                     ║                                                       |
|                     ║                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : YoungTableau                                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{-2,-4,-1})                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

If any $\lambda_i<\mu_i$, then the boxes in that row are drawn shaded.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : youngTableau(new Partition from {-2,-4,2}, new Partition from {1,-1,-1},|
|                                                                             |
|             ┌───┬───║───┐                                                   |
|o7 =         │░1░│░2░║░3░│                                                   |
|     ┌───┬───┼───┼───║───┘                                                   |
|     │░4░│░5░│░6░│   ║                                                       |
|     └───┴───┴───┼───║───┬───┐                                               |
|                 │ 7 ║ 8 │ 9 │                                               |
|                 └───║───┴───┘                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : YoungTableau                                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9})                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

The inner shape may be drawn by calling drawInnerShape.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : T'' = youngTableau(new Partition from {5,4,-1}, new Partition from      |
|                                                                             |
|                 ║       ┌───┬───┬───┐                                       |
|o8 =             ║       │   │   │   │                                       |
|                 ║       └───┴───┴───┘                                       |
|                 ║                                                           |
|     ┌───┬───┐   ║                                                           |
|     │   │   │   ║                                                           |
|     └───┴───┘   ║                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : YoungTableau                                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{2,4,-3})                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : drawInnerShape true                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o9 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : T''                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|                  ║       ┌───┬───┬───┐                                      |
|o10 =             ║ ■   ■ │   │   │   │                                      |
|                  ║       └───┴───┴───┘                                      |
|                  ║ ■   ■   ■   ■                                            |
|      ┌───┬───┐   ║                                                          |
|      │   │   │ ■ ║                                                          |
|      └───┴───┘   ║                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o10 : YoungTableau                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : drawInnerShape false                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o11 = false                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : T''                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|                  ║       ┌───┬───┬───┐                                      |
|o12 =             ║       │   │   │   │                                      |
|                  ║       └───┴───┴───┘                                      |
|                  ║                                                          |
|      ┌───┬───┐   ║                                                          |
|      │   │   │   ║                                                          |
|      └───┴───┘   ║                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o12 : YoungTableau                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

The filling may be of any class (besides *note null: (Macaulay2Doc)null,
objects), including other tableaux!

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i13 : youngTableau(lam,mu,for i from 1 to size T list randomTabloid lam)     |
