YoungTableau ++ YoungTableau -- direct sum of tableaux
******************************************************

  * Operator: *note ++: (Macaulay2Doc)++,
  * Usage: 
        T1 ++ T2
  * Inputs:
      * T1, an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, a
        tableau.
      * T2, an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, a
        tableau.
  * Outputs:
      * S, an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, a direct
        sum of T1 and T2.

Description
===========

The tableaux are combined into the disconnected components (not sharing an
edge) of a single tableau.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : T1 = youngTableau(new Partition from {5}, new Partition from {2})       |
|                                                                             |
|             ┌───┬───┬───┐                                                   |
|o1 =         │   │   │   │                                                   |
|             └───┴───┴───┘                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : YoungTableau                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : T2 = youngTableau(new Partition from {3,2}, new Partition from {1},     |
|                                                                             |
|         ┌───┬───┐                                                           |
|o2 =     │ 1 │ 2 │                                                           |
|     ┌───┼───┼───┘                                                           |
|     │ 3 │ 4 │                                                               |
|     └───┴───┘                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : YoungTableau                                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{1,2,3,4})                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : T1 ++ T2                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|                 ┌───┬───┬───┐                                               |
|o3 =             │   │   │   │                                               |
|         ┌───┬───┼───┴───┴───┘                                               |
|         │ 1 │ 2 │                                                           |
|     ┌───┼───┼───┘                                                           |
|     │ 3 │ 4 │                                                               |
|     └───┴───┘                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : YoungTableau                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : T2 ++ T1                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|                             ┌───┬───┐                                       |
|o4 =                         │ 1 │ 2 │                                       |
|                         ┌───┼───┼───┘                                       |
|                         │ 3 │ 4 │                                           |
|             ┌───┬───┬───┼───┴───┘                                           |
|             │   │   │   │                                                   |
|             └───┴───┴───┘                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : YoungTableau                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

