YoungTableau == YoungTableau -- check if two Young tableaux are equal
*********************************************************************

  * Operator: *note ==: (Macaulay2Doc)==,
  * Usage: 
        T1 == T2
  * Inputs:
      * T1, an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, a
        tableau.
      * T2, an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, a
        tableau.
  * Outputs:
      * b, a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, whether the tableaux
        are equal or not.

Description
===========

Two tableaux are equal if they have the same shape (ignoring trailing 0s), and
the same filling.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : T1 = youngTableau(new Partition from {5,3,1}, new Partition from {2},   |
|                                                                             |
|             ┌───┬───┬───┐                                                   |
|o1 =         │ 7 │ 2 │ 4 │                                                   |
|     ┌───┬───┼───┼───┴───┘                                                   |
|     │ 1 │ 3 │ 6 │                                                           |
|     ├───┼───┴───┘                                                           |
|     │ 5 │                                                                   |
|     └───┘                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : YoungTableau                                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{7,2,4,1,3,6,5})                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : T2 = youngTableau(new Partition from {5,3,1}, new Partition from {2},   |
|                                                                             |
|             ┌───┬───┬───┐                                                   |
|o2 =         │ 2 │ 7 │ 4 │                                                   |
|     ┌───┬───┼───┼───┴───┘                                                   |
|     │ 3 │ 6 │ 1 │                                                           |
|     ├───┼───┴───┘                                                           |
|     │ 5 │                                                                   |
|     └───┘                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : YoungTableau                                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{2,7,4,3,6,1,5})                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : T1 == T2                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = false                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note YoungTableau == YoungTableau: YoungTableau == YoungTableau, -- check
    if two Young tableaux are equal
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The source of this document is in Tableaux/documentation.m2:1860:0.

