YoungTableau ^ ZZ -- get the entries in a row
*********************************************

  * Operator: *note ^: (Macaulay2Doc)^,
  * Usage: 
        T^i
  * Inputs:
      * T, an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, a
        tableau.
      * i, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the index of a row.
  * Outputs:
      * l, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the entries in the $i$th row of
        T.

Description
===========

Note that the resulting list may contain *note null: (Macaulay2Doc)null,
entries in places where a box is not present. This means that the notations
(T^i)#j, (T_j)#i, and T_(i,j) are all equivalent for valid positions (i,j).
However, the notation T_(i,j) will raise an error for nonvalid positions,
whereas the other two will return *note null: (Macaulay2Doc)null,.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : T = youngTableau(new Partition from {4,3,1,0}, new Partition from {1,1},|
|                                                                             |
|         ┌───┬───┬───┐                                                       |
|o1 =     │ 1 │ 2 │ 3 │                                                       |
|         ├───┼───┼───┘                                                       |
|         │ 4 │ 5 │                                                           |
|     ┌───┼───┴───┘                                                           |
|     │ 6 │                                                                   |
|     └───┘                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : YoungTableau                                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{1,2,3,4,5,6})                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : for i from 0 to numRows T - 1 do print T^i                              |
|{, 1, 2, 3}                                                                  |
|{, 4, 5, }                                                                   |
|{6, , , }                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : (T^0)#1                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = 1                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : (T_1)#0                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = 1                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : T_(0,1)                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = 1                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

If T has negative rows, then the entries at negative column coordinates are to
the right in the output.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : T' = youngTableau(new Partition from {4,3,1,0}, new Partition from      |
|                                                                             |
|         ║   ┌───┬───┬───┐                                                   |
|o6 =     ║   │ 1 │ 2 │ 3 │                                                   |
|     ┌───║───┼───┼───┼───┘                                                   |
|     │ 4 ║ 5 │ 6 │ 7 │                                                       |
|     └───║───┼───┴───┘                                                       |
|         ║ 8 │                                                               |
|         ║───┘                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : YoungTableau                                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{1,-1}, {1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8})                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : for i from 0 to numRows T' - 1 do print T'^i                            |
|{, 1, 2, 3, }                                                                |
|{5, 6, 7, , 4}                                                               |
|{8, , , , }                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : T'^1#-1                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = 4                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : T'_(1,-1)                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o9 = 4                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

To get the row entries exactly as they appear in the tableau and without extra
null's, use rowEntries.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : T'' = youngTableau(new Partition from {3,4}, new Partition from {-2},  |
|                                                                             |
|      ┌───┬───║───┬───┬───┐                                                  |
|o10 = │ 1 │ 2 ║ 3 │ 4 │ 5 │                                                  |
|      └───┴───║───┼───┼───┼───┐                                              |
|              ║ 6 │ 7 │ 8 │ 9 │                                              |
|              ║───┴───┴───┴───┘                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o10 : YoungTableau                                                           |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9})                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : T''^0                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o11 = {3, 4, 5, , 1, 2}                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o11 : List                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : rowEntries(T'',0)                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o12 = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5}                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o12 : List                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

