YoungTableau _ ZZ -- get the entries in a column
************************************************

  * Operator: *note _: (Macaulay2Doc)_us,
  * Usage: 
        T_j
  * Inputs:
      * T, an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, a
        tableau.
      * j, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the index of a column.
  * Outputs:
      * l, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the entries in the $j$th column
        of T.

Description
===========

Note that the resulting list may contain *note null: (Macaulay2Doc)null,
entries in places where a box is not present. This means that the notations
(T^i)#j, (T_j)#i, and T_(i,j) are all equivalent for valid positions (i,j).
However, the notation T_(i,j) will raise an error for nonvalid positions,
whereas the other two will return *note null: (Macaulay2Doc)null,.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : T = youngTableau(new Partition from {4,3,1,0}, new Partition from {1,1},|
|                                                                             |
|         ┌───┬───┬───┐                                                       |
|o1 =     │ 1 │ 2 │ 3 │                                                       |
|         ├───┼───┼───┘                                                       |
|         │ 4 │ 5 │                                                           |
|     ┌───┼───┴───┘                                                           |
|     │ 6 │                                                                   |
|     └───┘                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : YoungTableau                                                            |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{1,2,3,4,5,6})                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : for i in columnRange T do print T_i                                     |
|{, , 6}                                                                      |
|{1, 4, }                                                                     |
|{2, 5, }                                                                     |
|{3, , }                                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : (T^0)#1                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = 1                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : (T_1)#0                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = 1                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : T_(0,1)                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = 1                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

To get the column entries without extra null's, use columnEntries.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : T'' = youngTableau(new Partition from {3,1}, new Partition from         |
|                                                                             |
|     ┌───┬───║───┬───┬───┐                                                   |
|o6 = │ 1 │ 2 ║ 3 │ 4 │ 5 │                                                   |
|     └───┴───║───┼───┴───┘                                                   |
|             ║ 6 │                                                           |
|         ┌───║───┘                                                           |
|         │ 7 ║                                                               |
|         └───║                                                               |
|                                                                             |
